            <span class="msv__tl-tag msv__tl-tag--urgent">Within the first week</span>
            <div class="msv__tl-title">Register on the Padrón (Empadronamiento)</div>
            <p>Visit your local town hall (ayuntamiento) and register your address on the padrón municipal. You will need your passport and proof of address (rental contract or property deed). The padrón certificate is required for almost everything that follows — including your TIE application.</p>
