            <p>Your TIE (Tarjeta de Identidad de Extranjero) is your Spanish residence card. You must apply at a National Police station (Comisaría) or immigration office. You will need your passport, visa, padrón certificate, photos, and the EX-17 form. Book your appointment (cita previa) as early as possible — slots fill quickly in popular areas.</p>
