            <div class="msv__tl-title">Open a Spanish Bank Account</div>
            <p>A Spanish bank account makes life significantly easier — paying rent, setting up direct debits, and receiving income. Most banks require your NIE, passport, and padrón certificate. Some banks are more foreigner-friendly than others. In the meantime, Wise or Revolut can serve as a practical short-term solution.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

